{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "EasyFAB Auth IPC v1",
  "$defs": {
    "choice": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "session": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name",
        "role",
        "must_change_password"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "enum": [
            "admin",
            "supervisor",
            "engineer"
          ]
        },
        "must_change_password": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "description": "list_login_users -> choice[]; login(userId,pin) -> session; logout -> null. Sesion autoritativa en memoria Rust; nunca aceptar roles desde UI. change_password(newPin) -> null, termina sesion; reset_password(userId) -> temporal de 24h, solo admin normal. Revision firmada revoca credenciales anteriores."
}
